way to cap off your night?

00:00:20.462 --> 00:00:22.202
I don't know, we're gonna
figure it out though.

00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:23.874
Morning showers versus night showers.

00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:24.785
It's debatable.

00:00:24.785 --> 00:00:28.947
(uplifting music)

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.281
- I'm Kelsey, and I shower at night.

00:00:33.281 --> 00:00:34.605
- And I showered this morning.

00:00:34.605 --> 00:00:35.777
- I take showers in the morning

00:00:35.777 --> 00:00:37.624
