00:02:30.955 --> 00:02:32.219
Most people in the morning,

00:02:32.219 --> 00:02:35.134
they take really hot
showers for a longer time

00:02:35.134 --> 00:02:35.937
because they're tired

00:02:35.937 --> 00:02:37.199
and they're tryin' to use it to wake up.

00:02:37.199 --> 00:02:37.839
