00:02:37.839 --> 00:02:39.418
A cold shower wakes you up.

00:02:39.418 --> 00:02:40.694
- Cold showers wake you up.

00:02:40.694 --> 00:02:42.495
Warm showers, they can relax you,

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.258
